          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml#p0058",
            "textSha256": "22b8f462ffbf8ebf4f5825ff34220d3c5876f63427a24bff12cc848cd9c67627"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, enjoy a scenic transfer to Ollantaytambo, where you will board the PR Expedition Train for your journey to Machu Picchu. The train ride offers breathtaking views of the Sacred Valley, winding through stunning landscapes as you approach the ancient Incan citadel.\n\nUpon arrival in Aguas Calientes, the gateway town to Machu Picchu, you will have free time to explore its charming streets, vibrant markets, and local attractions. This is the perfect opportunity to relax and immerse yourself in the tranquil atmosphere of the town before your upcoming visit to the iconic Machu Picchu."
    },
